 "sentences": [
  {
   "i": 0,
   "text": "This emperor made it illegal to melt ice.",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 2.24
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "text": "Not to freeze it. To melt it. If your ice turned to water, you were a criminal.",
   "s": 2.52,
   "e": 6.6
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "text": "You see, in ancient Rome, ice was worth more than the men who hauled it.",
   "s": 6.9,
   "e": 10.66
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "text": "It came down from the Alps on mule-back, packed in straw and sawdust.",
   "s": 10.9,
   "e": 14.56
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "text": "Every mile it travelled, it melted a little. So every drop of melt was money leaking away.",
   "s": 14.82,
   "e": 19.92
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "text": "Emperors loved their snow-chilled wine. Senators served it to show off.",
   "s": 20.24,
   "e": 24.14
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "text": "So the state stepped in. Ice became a regulated treasure.",
   "s": 24.38,
   "e": 27.76
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "text": "Melt someone else's ice, or let it slip? You could lose your hand.",
   "s": 28.04,
   "e": 31.54
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "text": "Some emperors even built ice houses under temples, like vaults for frozen gold.",
   "s": 31.78,
   "e": 36.72
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "text": "And here's the crazy part. It worked.",
   "s": 36.88,
   "e": 38.94
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "text": "For a few coins you could buy a chipped cup of snow in July.",
   "s": 39.1,
   "e": 42.08
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "text": "Rich Romans hosted parties just to prove they had ice, right there in the heat.",
   "s": 42.44,
   "e": 46.82
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "text": "The workers got frostbite hauling it down the mountain.",
   "s": 47.04,
   "e": 49.48
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "text": "The aristocrats got brain freeze drinking it up.",
   "s": 49.8,
   "e": 52.32
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "text": "It took seventeen hundred years before anyone thought, maybe ice shouldn't be illegal to melt.",
   "s": 52.46,
   "e": 57.34
  },
  {
   "i": 15,
   "text": "Turns out the emperor wasn't protecting the ice.",
   "s": 57.58,
   "e": 59.9
  },
  {
   "i": 16,
   "text": "He was protecting the right to be the only one who had it.",
   "s": 59.9,
   "e": 62.9
  }
 ]
}